WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.540
<b>BuyAbandonedProperty.web</b>

00:01.500 --> 00:03.420
"Buy Abandoned Property.web"?

00:03.750 --> 00:07.380
We find ourselves a haunted house
and turn it into a Graduate dorm!

00:08.080 --> 00:11.130
Inspection time. Let's ghooo...

00:11.130 --> 00:12.670
...ooost!

01:51.040 --> 01:51.830
Let's go.

01:52.170 --> 01:52.880
Yeah.

01:59.290 --> 02:00.750
The door just opened...

02:00.750 --> 02:03.670
There's no one there. We should've seen them
through the frosted glass.

02:10.920 --> 02:12.040
What is it?

02:12.290 --> 02:14.080
A wandering ghost just went inside.

02:15.500 --> 02:17.040
This area has a lot of ghost traffic.

02:18.000 --> 02:22.040
Ghost traffic? You mean like,
a lot of ghosts come through this area?

02:23.000 --> 02:25.080
Could that be why that incident happened here?

02:25.750 --> 02:26.710
Don't know.

02:27.290 --> 02:30.750
But we can find out if we see what happens to it inside.

02:31.130 --> 02:32.830
We'll know if they're friend or foe, too.

02:33.460 --> 02:34.130
Let's go.

02:36.460 --> 02:38.210
It could be super powerful.

02:38.710 --> 02:41.460
I wanna see it, but also kinda don't...

02:46.130 --> 02:48.170
No, I wanna see it...

02:55.420 --> 02:56.540
Do you see something?

02:56.920 --> 02:58.170
Looks like the dad and daughter.

02:58.170 --> 02:59.000
Wha-?!

02:59.460 --> 03:03.920
The dad and daughter renting the house
killed a bunch of people, then themselves.

03:04.920 --> 03:07.540
They're ushering the wandering ghost inside.

03:07.540 --> 03:09.080
Th-they are?

03:09.420 --> 03:10.130
Yeah.

03:14.750 --> 03:18.330
I can't tell why, though. We'll need to keep watching.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.670
Stay close to me.

03:19.670 --> 03:20.460
Right.

03:21.170 --> 03:22.790
Wait, what about your shoes?!

03:22.920 --> 03:24.670
I don't want to step on anything sharp.

03:26.210 --> 03:27.710
We can clean the floors later.

03:37.170 --> 03:38.130
Water?

03:43.500 --> 03:44.250
Eiko!

03:45.630 --> 03:49.210
No one lives here.
This shouldn't be here, either. Don't drink it.

03:49.750 --> 03:52.670
Wait, was I...?

04:01.000 --> 04:02.170
Must've been her.

04:11.250 --> 04:12.790
They poisoned the water...

04:13.750 --> 04:15.920
Are they reenacting their past crimes?

04:20.830 --> 04:21.750
What was that noise?

04:22.710 --> 04:25.500
Don't think it was the house. Sounded like footsteps.

04:26.710 --> 04:29.210
The ghosts are on the move. Let's follow them.

04:29.330 --> 04:30.580
O-okay.

04:43.380 --> 04:44.460
Is that a well?

04:44.960 --> 04:46.170
Why's it hidden under the floor?!

05:03.170 --> 05:06.380
It's just as I thought. They're reliving their murders.

05:07.380 --> 05:09.290
And that wandering ghost is their newest victim.

05:10.290 --> 05:13.040
What could have compelled them to do this?

05:27.040 --> 05:29.330
Wh-what was that?!

05:30.500 --> 05:32.000
Eiko could see it, too.

05:37.630 --> 05:40.040
If we stick around here, we might be its next snack.

05:40.420 --> 05:43.380
Let's head upstairs and either catch it or kill it.

05:43.710 --> 05:45.830
Leaving isn't an option?

05:46.000 --> 05:47.880
I thought you wanted to see it, Eiko.

05:49.040 --> 05:49.830
I do...

05:49.830 --> 05:50.880
Then let's see it.

05:52.460 --> 05:53.290
I'm confused.

05:53.920 --> 05:58.460
After we didn't drink their water,
they stopped coming after us. Why?

06:00.170 --> 06:01.670
What's their plan?

06:07.960 --> 06:09.880
This is the room right above where we were before.

06:23.920 --> 06:26.420
Is that a spiritual altar?

06:37.880 --> 06:40.630
Please, my precious angel...

06:44.330 --> 06:46.170
Mama?

06:51.460 --> 06:53.250
Let's head somewhere with more space.

06:53.580 --> 06:54.630
Y-yeah!

06:55.710 --> 06:57.080
What the heck was that thing?

06:57.080 --> 06:58.920
She called it an "angel."

06:59.750 --> 07:02.000
An angel?! Is she insane?!

07:05.170 --> 07:06.420
Wow, this looks delicious!

07:07.710 --> 07:10.540
Voices? Is someone else here?

07:11.500 --> 07:12.710
Saki made it.

07:12.920 --> 07:13.880
Wait...

07:13.880 --> 07:15.960
Well, you showed me how to do it, Mom!

07:16.330 --> 07:17.330
It looks great!

07:18.290 --> 07:20.460
Are these visions of their pasts?

07:21.460 --> 07:23.130
Looks like things were different then...

07:25.130 --> 07:26.210
Mom!

07:28.420 --> 07:33.420
Wake up, Mom! Please!

07:33.420 --> 07:34.500
I didn't mean to...

07:34.750 --> 07:37.130
Huh? What happened?

07:38.000 --> 07:41.790
We were just arguing, and I pushed her just a little...

07:39.670 --> 07:41.290
Mom...!

07:47.130 --> 07:47.880
Let's move on.

07:48.080 --> 07:49.540
O-okay.

07:59.250 --> 08:02.250
<b>MURDERERS</b>

08:04.830 --> 08:06.250
I can't take this anymore.

08:07.170 --> 08:09.750
Would you like it to stop?

08:11.790 --> 08:13.250
If salvation is your wish,

08:14.080 --> 08:16.790
I can give you knowledge of a lost ritual.

08:17.750 --> 08:23.080
Perform it, and an angel will grant you salvation.

08:29.040 --> 08:29.920
A futon?

08:30.290 --> 08:32.580
I'm not doing this, not with you!

08:32.580 --> 08:38.130
Dad, please, I want it to stop!
He said this was the only way!

08:38.330 --> 08:40.710
This will save us both!

08:41.290 --> 08:44.710
We have to do this! We have to!

08:52.420 --> 08:53.420
Another vision...

09:04.380 --> 09:06.960
Now, we have the perfect body for our angel...

09:07.630 --> 09:12.330
Just a little more. A little more, and we'll be in Heaven...

09:13.750 --> 09:15.540
We'll finally have salvation.

09:17.960 --> 09:20.420
I see why they committed their crimes now.

09:20.960 --> 09:25.750
They wanted to be rescued from the living hell
that came about from the mother's death.

09:26.750 --> 09:30.920
This "angel" is something that would give them
the salvation they were after.

09:31.790 --> 09:33.710
The daughter blindly believed it would work,

09:34.290 --> 09:40.380
so she performed the "rituals"
to create the angel at the second-floor altar.

09:41.080 --> 09:45.420
The altar was probably made from real human remains.

09:46.380 --> 09:51.630
Which the police likely cleaned up during
their investigation, but it remains here in spirit, literally.

09:52.290 --> 09:58.080
The rituals themselves...
were the crimes the father and daughter committed.

09:59.290 --> 10:03.130
From what I've seen of the ritual
and know of the incidents,

10:03.290 --> 10:06.330
I can piece together a rough timeline
of what happened in what order.

10:07.460 --> 10:12.750
First, they created the angel's "mother"
from human remains.

10:13.540 --> 10:18.040
Judging from the damage to the skull,
they must have used the mother's body.

10:19.170 --> 10:22.920
Next, the father and daughter
conceived a child, then killed it.

10:23.830 --> 10:27.000
The body would be used as a vessel for the angel's soul.

10:27.460 --> 10:32.920
The baby's soul was likely used
to nourish the "mother" and create the "angel" itself.

10:33.710 --> 10:36.580
After that came the murders.

10:37.000 --> 10:39.040
Those souls fed the "angel."

10:39.670 --> 10:43.330
That's why it was so big. That was the "angel."

10:44.380 --> 10:48.580
They were your normal, everyday family,
broken to pieces by a horrific accident.

10:48.790 --> 10:54.130
Desperate to escape their circumstances,
they turned to murder and fanatic rituals.

10:54.750 --> 10:59.540
Which, in turn, led to the creation of an evil spirit,
and even more horror.

11:00.380 --> 11:02.460
The last thing either of them wanted.

11:03.880 --> 11:05.330
One question remains, though.

11:05.790 --> 11:10.250
They accomplished their goal.
They successfully created their "angel."

11:10.960 --> 11:16.130
So why are they still reenacting their crimes
with wandering ghosts?

11:17.630 --> 11:20.750
She said they needed to do "a little more."
Is that why they're still here?

11:21.880 --> 11:23.330
And how did they die?

11:22.500 --> 11:23.920
Mama?

11:24.790 --> 11:26.170
Mama...

11:28.210 --> 11:29.040
It's coming!

11:39.790 --> 11:41.710
Mama!

11:52.960 --> 11:54.290
Mama...

12:01.380 --> 12:03.330
Mama!

12:23.710 --> 12:24.460
You okay?

12:25.040 --> 12:27.080
Thanks. I'm okay...

12:27.710 --> 12:31.080
Can we go back to the car? I need to take a second...

12:31.420 --> 12:32.000
Sure.

12:33.670 --> 12:36.580
I wanted to catch it and use it to guard the house...

12:37.500 --> 12:38.750
But, oh well.

12:43.170 --> 12:44.920
I thought I was a goner...

12:45.880 --> 12:48.460
Mama.

12:59.330 --> 13:01.000
It's locked! No!

13:04.250 --> 13:06.000
Mama...

13:07.670 --> 13:08.830
Mama!

13:12.080 --> 13:12.880
Eiko!

13:15.000 --> 13:17.420
Are you okay? What happened?!

13:19.420 --> 13:20.380
Mama.

13:25.670 --> 13:26.500
Let me see.

13:30.250 --> 13:31.540
Mama.

13:33.250 --> 13:34.290
Mama...

13:34.290 --> 13:35.710
What... the hell...?

13:37.290 --> 13:39.790
This time, the ritual will finally work.

13:42.330 --> 13:46.790
I just had one last step to complete, but it didn't work...

13:48.170 --> 13:53.540
A female officer who searched the house
after the incident suddenly fell pregnant,

13:53.710 --> 13:57.000
and ten days later, she gave birth
to a baby with a giant head.

13:57.580 --> 14:00.130
It tore straight through her abdomen.

14:01.170 --> 14:02.500
A pregnancy curse.

14:01.250 --> 14:03.500
<b>PREGNANCY CURSE...</b>

14:05.290 --> 14:08.040
It didn't work with the police officer, either.

14:08.580 --> 14:10.580
That answers one of my questions.

14:11.130 --> 14:14.790
I was wondering why the ghosts weren't trying to hurt us.

14:15.830 --> 14:18.040
It's because they didn't need a sacrifice.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.580
They needed a mother.

14:22.080 --> 14:26.130
Mama... Mama...

14:22.080 --> 14:23.540
It answers my other question, too:

14:23.540 --> 14:27.210
why are they reenacting their crimes
if they successfully created their "angel"?

14:28.460 --> 14:33.630
Because they didn't.
There's one last step to create their "angel."

14:34.500 --> 14:45.000
It needs to invade a living woman's body
and be birthed into a physical form.

14:45.420 --> 14:47.290
That last step hasn't succeeded yet.

14:48.130 --> 14:52.630
They'll keep impregnating living women
until it's truly "born."

14:53.460 --> 14:57.630
This time, I know you'll be born healthy,
my precious angel.

14:58.170 --> 15:03.500
Then your miracle of life will save all of us.

15:04.000 --> 15:08.040
To remove the curse,
we need to destroy the spirit that placed the curse.

15:08.540 --> 15:12.670
But we've already devoured the "angel."

15:13.920 --> 15:15.380
So how is it still here?

15:17.040 --> 15:20.500
There were three mummified corpses on the altar.

15:20.920 --> 15:21.750
Mama.

15:22.080 --> 15:22.830
Mama.

15:23.170 --> 15:24.250
Mama.

15:24.250 --> 15:26.380
That means there are two more!

15:27.630 --> 15:33.000
We have to kill all the "angels," or Eiko will die!

15:36.920 --> 15:39.750
Seems like I got some strength back after eating...

15:39.750 --> 15:42.420
Wow, he's posing in the mirror.

15:42.460 --> 15:46.210
<b>Keitaro's Younger Twin Sister</b>

15:42.460 --> 15:46.210
<b>Keitaro's Younger Twin Sister</b>

15:42.460 --> 15:46.210
<b>Akari Gentoga</b>

15:42.460 --> 15:46.210
<b>Yuzuki Gentoga</b>

15:42.630 --> 15:44.130
Look how wimpy he is.

15:44.130 --> 15:46.210
Yikes, bro...

15:46.210 --> 15:47.830
Yuzuki?! Akari?!

15:47.830 --> 15:50.130
Wh-what do you want?

15:50.540 --> 15:51.330
You got a call.

15:51.670 --> 15:53.380
A video call.

15:53.380 --> 15:54.250
We picked it up for you!

15:55.380 --> 15:59.460
Sorry, I was just changing! Um...

15:59.670 --> 16:00.830
Kei-kun...

16:00.960 --> 16:04.540
Wanna hit the gym together after Golden Week?

16:04.540 --> 16:07.130
Huh?! I look that bad?!

16:10.500 --> 16:12.330
That bad, huh...?

16:12.330 --> 16:13.040
Ack!

16:13.290 --> 16:16.540
H-hey, you should have a fitness goal, yeah?!

16:17.000 --> 16:19.080
Maybe you wanna get kinda macho!

16:19.540 --> 16:22.420
And I could get super fit for you! Sound good?

16:22.880 --> 16:24.420
Y-yeah.

16:24.420 --> 16:25.210
Plus...

16:25.580 --> 16:30.960
...it'd be cool if you could carry me
like a princess one day.

16:32.920 --> 16:35.040
I-I'll see what I can do.

16:35.290 --> 16:37.830
Thanks. That makes me feel better!

16:38.630 --> 16:39.830
Talk to you soon!

16:40.380 --> 16:41.580
O-okay.

16:45.000 --> 16:47.420
What? What's that for?!

16:47.420 --> 16:49.170
Oh, nothing.

16:52.630 --> 16:55.210
I didn't know Keitaro had little sisters.

16:55.750 --> 16:59.460
He's got a little brother, too. I'll introduce you sometime.

17:03.630 --> 17:05.040
Okay, that's it.

17:06.290 --> 17:07.420
If you're ready...

17:08.170 --> 17:11.210
...then let's get rid of the "angel" and remove its curse.

17:11.630 --> 17:16.920
To force it out of you, I'm going to have to attack it.

17:17.330 --> 17:20.920
There's a chance it'll go berserk
and hurt you in the process.

17:21.540 --> 17:24.380
Worst case scenario, it'll tear open your belly to get out.

17:24.830 --> 17:28.380
It's okay. Talking to Kei-kun
gave me all the courage I need.

17:29.130 --> 17:32.290
I'm not dying here,
not until I get him to hold me like a princess!

17:32.790 --> 17:33.960
Let's make this quick.

17:42.330 --> 17:44.170
It's not hurting Eiko.

17:44.710 --> 17:46.460
The doll must be taking all the damage.

17:47.250 --> 17:53.330
That means it hasn't formed a physical body yet,
so it won't do physical damage to her.

17:53.960 --> 17:58.500
And there won't be anything left inside her once it's gone.

18:00.790 --> 18:04.000
Cry and shriek all you want. It won't stop me.

18:04.830 --> 18:07.040
Go ahead and die,
I'll stab you through your dying throes.

18:07.960 --> 18:09.460
I won't stop until I'm done.

18:11.210 --> 18:13.710
If you want it to stop, then get out.

18:28.540 --> 18:30.630
There's something left. I knew it.

18:31.750 --> 18:32.960
What do you mean?

18:33.130 --> 18:34.130
Evil spirits create curses,

18:34.130 --> 18:35.750
and curses can survive independently.

18:34.460 --> 18:45.630
<b>  SPIRIT</b>

18:35.250 --> 18:36.380
<b>CREATE</b>

18:35.250 --> 18:48.880
<b>CURSE</b>

18:35.250 --> 18:48.880
<b>CURSE</b>

18:36.130 --> 18:38.290
But there's a catch.

18:38.920 --> 18:42.170
The evil spirit has to feed the curse energy

18:42.170 --> 18:43.630
to keep it going.

18:43.880 --> 18:46.630
That's why, if you kill the spirit,

18:46.630 --> 18:49.540
it stops powering the curse, so it disappears.

18:50.040 --> 18:54.460
If we want to make this curse disappear,
then that's what we're going to have to do.

18:55.170 --> 18:59.000
The source powering this curse
is most likely the three "angels" in the house.

18:59.670 --> 19:04.630
We've already killed two,
so we just need to finish off the last one.

19:05.130 --> 19:09.130
Then the curse won't have any energy
to power it, and it'll disappear.

19:11.040 --> 19:14.330
The last one is in the house. Let's go get it.

19:14.920 --> 19:19.330
Yeah! Once it's sorted out,
we'll have ourselves a super-cheap house!

19:19.500 --> 19:21.880
A house that can hold all our Graduates!

19:24.790 --> 19:27.330
It might try to come at us from above.

19:29.170 --> 19:30.790
Listen for any creaking noises.

19:30.790 --> 19:31.880
Got it!

19:42.380 --> 19:43.210
Ow!

19:53.380 --> 19:54.250
Ow!

20:08.920 --> 20:10.880
Eiko? Eiko!

20:11.130 --> 20:11.830
Eiko!

20:13.580 --> 20:15.880
A-an illusion?

20:16.000 --> 20:17.000
Are you okay?

20:17.580 --> 20:18.500
Sorry.

20:19.750 --> 20:20.790
I need...

20:24.040 --> 20:25.540
I need some air...

20:31.040 --> 20:31.920
She's gone.

20:34.670 --> 20:36.000
All I did was walk outside.

20:36.540 --> 20:37.750
We got split up!

20:39.460 --> 20:40.290
She's still inside.

20:43.830 --> 20:45.790
H-how did I get here?

21:01.210 --> 21:02.170
Ow...

21:03.330 --> 21:04.670
Wh-what...?

21:05.330 --> 21:07.170
Mama.

21:07.420 --> 21:08.290
It's coming!

21:24.880 --> 21:26.380
<b>Yayoi-chan</b>

21:26.630 --> 21:28.000
Oh... oh, no!

21:37.880 --> 21:39.750
No... No!

21:42.290 --> 21:51.000
NO!

23:22.130 --> 23:26.380
A ghost has chosen Eiko to be its mother.

23:27.500 --> 23:33.830
Yayoi fights back against the evil fetus to no avail,

23:34.880 --> 23:40.250
and the grisly truth behind the curse
binding the property to its fate is finally revealed.
